{"4285510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Scourge", "steam_appid": 4285510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LORE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chosen to reclaim a planet consumed by the Scourge, you’re endlessly dragged back from death by fading Elder Gods. Every run is another attempt to take it back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SUMMARY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scourge is a run-based boomer shooter with a hand crafted, persistent, living dungeon. The dungeon shifts every run: rooms change, NPCs move or disappear, enemies claim territory, and safe spaces can turn into ambushes. Restore power, reactivate machinery, and bring systems back online—unlocking new paths, hazards, and survival tools as you push deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, creative combat built on chaining effects. Damage enemies to hex them. Bullets interact differently with hexed enemies, turning every attack into escalating chaos:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Rockets split into cluster barrages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Bullets ricochet between targets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Black holes pull enemies together</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Electric fields shock and chain damage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Charm grenades turn enemies on each other</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LORE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chosen to reclaim a planet consumed by the Scourge, you’re endlessly dragged back from death by fading Elder Gods. Every run is another attempt to take it back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SUMMARY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scourge is a run-based boomer shooter with a hand crafted, persistent, living dungeon. The dungeon shifts every run: rooms change, NPCs move or disappear, enemies claim territory, and safe spaces can turn into ambushes. Restore power, reactivate machinery, and bring systems back online—unlocking new paths, hazards, and survival tools as you push deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, creative combat built on chaining effects. Damage enemies to hex them. Bullets interact differently with hexed enemies, turning every attack into escalating chaos:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Rockets split into cluster barrages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Bullets ricochet between targets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Black holes pull enemies together</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Electric fields shock and chain damage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Charm grenades turn enemies on each other</p>", "short_description": "Carve through an ever shifting cyberknight dungeon using alien powers and haunted firearms.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4285510/87602b97f30c2f4e6ebb8552f0034d66ffd166fa/header.jpg?t=1782524813", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4285510/f1d2977b871e1f36eee6ed66d2cf9155d6ce3edc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782524813", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4285510/f1d2977b871e1f36eee6ed66d2cf9155d6ce3edc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782524813", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Arvaker"], "publishers": ["Arvaker"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steams